#2068
Within Tyrybblyn~
You stand at the center of a large cavern, the ceiling so high you cannot see
it.  Slaves of the drow move about, doing their duty to their masters.  High
above  you, the sound of a cruel wind can be heard, whistling about the
stalactites  on the roof.  It is quite cold here.  A small hole, just wide
enough to fit through, is carved into the rock floor.  The smell of smoke
drifts up through the opening.
